      "content": "yeah i get the encryption part. but i guess i'm more worried about the more subtle things. like, how do i know if someone is quietly scraping my customer list or if some kind of background process is just siphoning off info without throwing a huge alarm? is there a way to keep an eye on those kinds of little hidden activities so they don't just bypass my main security?",
